7831:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ICPOLARITY_BOTHEDGE
7832:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  TIM_ICSelection specifies the input to be used.
7833:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
