7840:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @note TIM_ICFilter and TIM_ICPolarity are not used in INDIRECT mode as TI2FP1
