7926:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ICSELECTION_TRC: TIM Input 2 is selected to be connected to TRC.
